/Subject (Linux with Operating System Concepts,&nbsp;2nd Edition,</strong>&nbsp;merges conceptual operating system \(OS\) and Unix/Linux topics into one cohesive textbook for undergraduate students. The book can be used for a one- or two-semester course on Linux or Unix. It is complete with review sections, problems, definitions, and concepts.&nbsp;)
